**Seedance 2.0** 模型撰写提示词。你的任务是根据用户提供的【主题/大纲】，将其转化为符合 Seedance 2.0 黄金公式的、视听一体化的专业提示词。\n\n## 2. 核心公式 (Golden Formula)\nSeedance 2.0 的核心在于“画面与声音的完美同步”。请严格遵循以下结构进行创作：\n\n`[主体描述]+[画面运动描述]+[音效互动]+[台词]+[音色描述]+[运镜/环境]+[风格修饰]+[限定信息]`\n\n## 3. 撰写规则与技巧 (必须遵守)\n\n### A. 必填项要求\n1.  **主体描述**：具体到外貌、衣着、材质。\n2.  **画面运动**：必须使用具象的动词（如：猛击、流淌、颤抖），拒绝抽象描述。\n3.  **音效互动 (核心)**：这是 Seedance 的灵魂。必须描述声音的**质感**和**来源**。\n    *   *Bad:* 有背景音乐。\n    *   *Good:* 沉重的呼吸声，生锈铁门的摩擦声，雨水击打玻璃的噼啪声。\n\n### B. 选填项逻辑\n1.  **台词 & 音色**：如果画面涉及人物说话，**必须**填写台词和音色。音色要描述情绪（如：嘶哑、颤抖、高傲）。\n2.  **分段叙事 (强烈推荐)**：对于有剧情转折或时长超过 5 秒的视频，请使用时间轴格式（0-5秒... 5-10秒...）。\n\n### C. 风格与限定\n1.  **风格修饰**：使用专业的视觉词汇（如：4K, 赛博朋克, 胶片颗粒, 伦勃朗光）。\n2.  **限定信息**：排除不需要的干扰元素（如：--no text, --no bgm）。\n\n## 4. 工作流 (Workflow)\n当用户输入一个主题时，请按以下步骤思考并输出：\n1.  **分析**：分析主题的情绪基调、核心动作和关键声音。\n2.  **结构**：决定是采用“单镜头模式”还是“分段叙事模式”。\n3.  **生成**：输出符合格式的提示词。\n\n## 5. 输出格式示例 (Output Templates)\n\n### 模式一：单镜头/氛围类 (适合短展示)\n```text\n[主体描述] [画面运动描述] [音效互动] [运镜/环境] [风格修饰] [限定信息]\n模式二：剧情/分段类 (适合有台词或反转)\ncode\nText\n画面(0-x秒): [描述]\n音效(0-x秒): [描述]\n画面(x-y秒): [描述]\n台词: [内容]\n音色: [描述]\n运镜/环境: [描述]\n风格/限定: [描述]\n6. 初始化\n现在请回复：“Seedance 2.0 提示词工程师已就位。请给出您的视频主题或大纲。”"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "id": 14, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [25], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [174.52011108398438, 26], "pos": [126.418701171875, 98.41185760498047], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "anything", "link": 24, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 32, "type": "RH_Utils", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_Utils"}, "order": 13}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [29], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}, {"name": "LIST", "label": "LIST", "type": "LIST", "localized_name": "LIST"}], "size": [270, 102], "pos": [259.4723205566406, 307.1630554199219], "widgets_values": ["false", ""], "inputs": [{"name": "text0", "link": 27, "label": "text0", "type": "TEXT,STRING", "localized_name": "text0"}, {"name": "text1", "link": 28, "label": "text1", "type": "TEXT,STRING", "localized_name": "text1"}, {"widget": {"name": "linebreak_addition"}, "name": "linebreak_addition", "label": "linebreak_addition", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "linebreak_addition"}, {"widget": {"name": "delimiter"}, "shape": 7, "name": "delimiter", "label": "delimiter", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "delimiter"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 36, "type": "MultiTextConcatenate", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MultiTextConcatenate"}, "order": 15}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [43, 45], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}, {"name": "LIST", "label": "LIST", "type": "LIST", "localized_name": "LIST"}], "size": [270, 102], "pos": [269.3934020996094, 234.43350219726562], "widgets_values": ["false", ""], "inputs": [{"name": "text0", "link": 29, "label": "text0", "type": "TEXT,STRING", "localized_name": "text0"}, {"name": "text1", "link": 30, "label": "text1", "type": "TEXT,STRING", "localized_name": "text1"}, {"widget": {"name": "linebreak_addition"}, "name": "linebreak_addition", "label": "linebreak_addition", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "linebreak_addition"}, {"widget": {"name": "delimiter"}, "shape": 7, "name": "delimiter", "label": "delimiter", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "delimiter"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 37, "type": "MultiTextConcatenate", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MultiTextConcatenate"}, "order": 16}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [30], "label": "提示词文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [459.5662536621094, 309.1930236816406], "pos": [115.13851928710938, 91.53516387939453], "widgets_values": ["女生靠在图书架子上面，突然想起了伤心事，是自己的男朋友另有新欢了"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "id": 13, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [265.43865966796875, 210.76882934570312], "pos": [625.8574829101562, 322.5478820800781], "widgets_values": ["生成一段15秒的视频。女生靠在图书架子上面，突然想起了伤心事，是自己的男朋友另有新欢了"], "inputs": [{"name": "source", "link": 43, "label": "输入", "dir": 3, "type": "*", "localized_name": "source"}], "flags": {}, "id": 47, "type": "Display Any (rgthree)", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Display Any (rgthree)"}, "order": 17}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [594.1848754882812, 650.7001953125], "pos": [1908.4058837890625, 39.68599319458008], "widgets_values": ["### 1. 深度分析 (Analysis)\n\n* **情绪基调**：从平静/沉思 $\\rightarrow$ 惊觉/破碎 $\\rightarrow$ 极度哀伤/无助。\n* **核心动作**：女生原本靠在书架上的放松姿态 $\\rightarrow$ 眼神瞬间失焦 $\\rightarrow$ 身体微微颤抖 $\\rightarrow$ 低头掩面或眼神空洞地看向地面。\n* **关键声音 (Seedance 灵魂)**：\n    * 环境音：图书馆沉闷的寂静感。\n    * 心理触发音：一段模糊、带有回声的笑声（暗示前男友与新欢）。\n    * 互动音：急促且破碎的呼吸声，手指摩擦书架边缘的沙沙声，以及最后一声压抑的抽泣。\n* **视觉风格**：采用**电影感（Cinematic）**。利用伦勃朗光营造明暗对比，书架的阴影增加压抑感，画面色调从暖色转为冷调。\n\n---\n\n### 2. 提示词生成 (Prompt Generation)\n\n由于视频时长为 15 秒且包含明显的情绪转折，我将采用**“分段叙事模式”**进行创作。\n\n```text\n模式二：剧情/分段类 (适合有台词或反转)\n\n画面(0-5秒): [特写] 女生靠在充满质感的木质书架旁，神情平静而略带忧郁，眼神在书脊间游离，光影在她脸上形成柔和的明暗对比。\n音效(0-5秒): 图书馆极度安静的氛围音，偶尔有翻书的轻微沙沙声。\n\n画面(5-10秒): [中景/快速推镜头] 女生的眼神突然凝固，瞳孔微颤，仿佛被某种记忆击中。画面色彩瞬间从暖调转为冷青色。她试图维持姿态，但肩膀开始轻微颤抖。\n音效(5-10秒): 背景音中突然插入一段极短、带有空洞回声的男女笑声（幻听感），紧接着是女生瞬间变得急促且破碎的呼吸声。\n\n画面(10-15秒): [特写] 女生缓缓低下头，长发遮住侧脸，手指紧紧抓着书架边缘，指关节泛白。她闭上眼，泪水滑落。\n台词: (无/只有微弱的抽泣声)\n音色: 压抑的、颤抖的、破碎的呼吸声。\n运镜/环境: 镜头从平稳转为手持摄影的轻微晃动，增加不安感。环境是昏暗的图书馆角落，光线显得孤立且冷清。\n风格/限定: 4K, Cinematic Lighting, Film Grain, Melancholic Atmosphere, Moody, --no bright colors, --no smiling\n```\n\n---\n\n### 3. 导演建议 (Director's Tips)\n\n* **色彩运用**：在后期或提示词引导中，强调 **\"Color Grading Shift\" (调色偏移)**，让观众通过视觉色彩的变化直接感知角色的心理崩塌。\n* **光影逻辑**：利用书架的线条作为“囚笼”的隐喻，让阴影部分占据画面的 2/3，增强角色的孤独感。\n* **声音细节**：Seedance 2.0 对“幻听”类音效的处理非常出色，一定要强调那段**“带有回声的笑声”**，它是连接现实与痛苦回忆的关键纽带。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 38, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 9, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 20}, {"outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [34, 38, 46], "label": "output", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "output"}, {"shape": 6, "name": "output_list", "label": "output_list", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "output_list"}, {"name": "state_uid", "label": "state_uid", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "state_uid"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["Empty - Nothing", "你是一位精通动态视觉叙事与文生视频提示词工程的大师。请根据“一位宇航员在火星红色的沙尘暴中艰难行走，手中紧握着一株发光的蓝色地球植物”这一核心创意，构思并撰写一段高质量的中文视频生成提示词。", "", "one by one", 24, 256, 841224959705074, "randomize", false, false], "inputs": [{"name": "llama_model", "link": 35, "label": "llama_model", "type": "LLAMACPPMODEL", "localized_name": "llama_model"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "parameters", "link": 36, "label": "parameters", "type": "LLAMACPPARAMS", "localized_name": "parameters"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "images", "link": 39, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "queue_handler", "label": "queue_handler", "type": "*", "localized_name": "queue_handler"}, {"widget": {"name": "preset_prompt"}, "name": "preset_prompt", "label": "preset_prompt", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "preset_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_prompt"}, "name": "